POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "BTC/USDT",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "quantity": 0,
  "price": 50000.00
}

### Negative Price
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "BTC/USDT",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
